{"ref":"BDB, סִבְלָה","hw":"סִבְלָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">סִבְלָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. burden</strong>;—pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">סִבְלֹת מִצְרַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:6\" href=\"/Exodus.6.6\">Ex 6:6</a> (P), of the heavy labours imposed on Isr. by Egyptian, v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:7\" href=\"/Exodus.6.7\">7</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">סִבְלֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:4\" href=\"/Exodus.5.4\">5:4</a> (J), <span dir=\"rtl\">סִבְלֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:11\" href=\"/Exodus.1.11\">1:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:5\" href=\"/Exodus.5.5\">5:5</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:11\" href=\"/Exodus.2.11\">2:11</a> (E); (cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 81:7\" href=\"/Psalms.81.7\">ψ 81:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">סֵבֶל</span>).","next":"BDB, סִבֹּ֫לֶת","prev":"BDB, סַבָּל"}